   "en": "Before going to war with the Allies conquer both ⟦0⟧ and ⟦1⟧. You should declare on ⟦2⟧ first, as their port is much easier to invade than ⟦3⟧. As long as you haven't joined the Comintern and you do this during WWII they should not get guaranteed. Remember to only annex the states from ⟦4⟧ that border the Red Sea and to puppet the rest. Otherwise, you might get overrun on the Arabian Peninsula",
